    "note": "The numeral 11 is NOT on the sheet \u2014 the name stands where it would be. What is on the sheet is the tier's numbering either side of it: the block west of Cass Street is lettered 12 and the block east of Rush Street is lettered 10, both transcribed from the crops below, and both sitting astride their block's mid-line the way every numeral in the Addition does. A tier that runs 12, name, 10 leaves one slot, and it is 11. That is arithmetic on two read numerals, not a reading of a third, so it is inferred and not documented. The Addition's numbering as a whole is T-1061's to read.",
